---
import SeaPattern from "../assets/sea-pattern.svg";
---
<div class="h-90 bg-brand-primary relative text-brand-concrete">
    <div style={{'--pattern-url': `url(${SeaPattern.src})`}}
         class="h-90 w-full bg-[#1A3D67] absolute top-0
             mask-(--pattern-url) mask-repeat mask-center mask-size-[auto_calc(100%/2)]"
    >
    </div>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col h-full justify-center items-center gap-3
    p-6 text-center">
        <div class="text-3xl md:text-h1 font-semibold">
            Let's talk.
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 font-normal">
            The best way to know if we’re a fit is to talk it through.
        </div>
        <div class="text-sm md:text-subtitle1 bg-white rounded-sm text-brand-primary w-fit py-3 px-6.25">
            Schedule a call
        </div>
    </div>
</div>